     "body": "<p>Example:</p>\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>[whikloj@net227.lib.umanitoba.ca 8:40 ] \r\n[/sw/var/www/DAM2/test_objects] \r\n&gt; shasum -a 1 IMG_2437.JPG\r\n1589663722e1d5ce49420a58db0a3d25c9b43b85  IMG_2437.JPG\r\n\r\n[whikloj@net227.lib.umanitoba.ca 8:40 ] \r\n[/sw/var/www/DAM2/test_objects] \r\n&gt; md5 IMG_2437.JPG \r\nMD5 (IMG_2437.JPG) = 407d039bbaf3b357600c4f3acca4cdad\r\n[whikloj@net227.lib.umanitoba.ca 8:41 ] \r\n[/sw/var/www/DAM2/test_objects] \r\n\r\n# Using invalid SHA-1\r\n&gt; curl -i -XPOST -H\"Content-type: image/jpeg\" --data-binary \"@IMG_2437.JPG\" -H\"digest: sha1=1589663722e1d5ce49420a58db0a3d25c9b43b8\" http://localhost:8080/rest\r\nHTTP/1.1 100 Continue\r\n\r\nHTTP/1.1 409 Conflict\r\nDate: Thu, 07 Jul 2016 13:43:05 GMT\r\nContent-Type: text/turtle\r\nContent-Length: 123\r\nServer: Jetty(9.3.1.v20150714)\r\n\r\nChecksum Mismatch of urn:sha1:1589663722e1d5ce49420a58db0a3d25c9b43b85 and urn:sha1:1589663722e1d5ce49420a58db0a3d25c9b43b8\r\n\r\n# Using valid MD5 checksum\r\n[whikloj@net227.lib.umanitoba.ca 8:43 ] \r\n[/sw/var/www/DAM2/test_objects] \r\n&gt; curl -i -XPOST -H\"Content-type: image/jpeg\" --data-binary \"@IMG_2437.JPG\" -H\"digest: md5=407d039bbaf3b357600c4f3acca4cdad\" http://localhost:8080/rest\r\nHTTP/1.1 100 Continue\r\n\r\nHTTP/1.1 201 Created\r\nDate: Thu, 07 Jul 2016 13:43:36 GMT\r\nETag: \"ce8862cc830f2960f4cc4df5838905546e524f14\"\r\nLast-Modified: Thu, 07 Jul 2016 13:43:37 GMT\r\nLink: &lt;http://localhost:8080/rest/a7/b8/43/b7/a7b843b7-16f6-4038-8105-9276cef1bd99/fcr:metadata&gt;; rel=\"describedby\"; anchor=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/a7/b8/43/b7/a7b843b7-16f6-4038-8105-9276cef1bd99\"\r\nLocation: http://localhost:8080/rest/a7/b8/43/b7/a7b843b7-16f6-4038-8105-9276cef1bd99\r\nContent-Type: text/plain\r\nContent-Length: 75\r\nServer: Jetty(9.3.1.v20150714)\r\n\r\nhttp://localhost:8080/rest/a7/b8/43/b7/a7b843b7-16f6-4038-